Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"q25": "<h3 id=\"例25-庚辰日-贵人临身又被拱护-旬空-天将\">【例25】庚辰日 · 贵人临身又被拱护 <code>旬空</code> <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：拱贵格 · 庚辰日昼占，干上丑乘昼贵，三传下贼上</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>庚辰日</strong>白天占官职能否升擢。盘里贵人直接临到日干上，三传又从前后拱着庚干，是求官见提携的一种完整结构。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　父母　天空</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　子孙　螣蛇</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>寅 → 未 → 子</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>庚金，干上 <strong>丑</strong>、支上 <strong>酉</strong>，发用 <strong>寅</strong>。庚辰属甲戌旬，空申酉。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　求官先看贵人有没有临身</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求官重视<strong>贵人</strong>，象征上级、提携者和能替我成事的人。贵人是十二天将之首，五行属<strong>土</strong>；各日干又有固定的昼贵、夜贵位置。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：庚日白天的贵人在<strong>丑</strong>。本盘干上恰是丑，等于<strong>昼贵临干</strong>、贵人贴身，先得一层上级照拂之象。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　初末前后引从，把日干拱在中间</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：初传在日干寄宫之前叫&quot;引&quot;，末传在其后叫&quot;从&quot;；一前一后围着日干，像有人前拉后推，求官常主被引荐、被抬举。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：庚寄申宫，初传寅居前为引，末传子居后为从，庚干在初末之间；再加干上丑贵人（土），所以称<strong>拱贵格</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　三传都见&quot;下贼上&quot;，事情有推动力</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：天盘为上、地盘为下；地盘五行克天盘叫<strong>下贼上</strong>。在此格原义里，连续下贼上表示下方力量向上发动，配合贵人引从，用作升擢之象。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：寅木临酉金，金克木；未土临寅木，木克土；子水临未土，土克水——三传都由下克上。虽支上酉旬空，但核心的<strong>干上丑贵与初末拱干</strong>不空，仍以官职升擢论。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：官职升擢，得贵人提携（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 贵人天将属土、主上级提携　② 庚日昼贵在丑　③ 初末引从可拱日干　④ 寅临酉、未临寅、子临未皆下贼上</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·拱贵格</p>\n<hr>", "q26": "<h3 id=\"例26-丁酉日-两贵夹住申命-年命-天将\">【例26】丁酉日 · 两贵夹住申命 <code>年命</code> <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：昼夜贵临干支拱年命申 · 丁酉日（下盘昼占示例）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丁酉日</strong>白天占告贵求事，并设占者本命或行年在<strong>申</strong>。两位贵人分别落在干、支上，刚好把申命夹在中间。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　妻财　朱雀</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">己　官鬼　贵人</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　子孙　太阴</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>酉 → 亥 → 丑</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>丁火，干上与发用为 <strong>酉</strong>，支上 <strong>亥</strong>；本例另取年命 <strong>申</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　贵人为什么分昼贵、夜贵</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：同一日干有昼贵与夜贵两处位置。贵人天将五行属<strong>土</strong>，但这里首先用的是它的<strong>位置象</strong>：看两处贵人位落在哪里、是否围着占者。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丁日的<strong>夜贵在酉、昼贵在亥</strong>。本盘干上酉、支上亥，两处贵人位分别临干与临支，自己与事情两端都有贵人照应。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　年命把格局落到具体的人</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：本命、行年代表占者更具体的个人落点。贵人只在盘中出现，还不如贵人把年命夹住来得贴身；前后夹拱，象两位上级共同成全此人。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本例年命取<strong>申</strong>，酉在申前、亥在申后，昼夜两贵把申命拱在其中。于是贵气不是泛泛在盘里，而是明确围着占者。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　什么问题最适合这样断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：贵人拱年命最适合告贵、求上级办事、引荐或审批；若没有给出年命，就只能断盘中贵人条件好，不能凭空说夹住了谁。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本例已明确年命申，因此可断<strong>宜告贵用事、必得两贵人成就</strong>。讲解时必须保留&quot;年命在申&quot;这个条件，换一个年命便要重新看是否仍被夹拱。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：宜告贵用事，必得两贵人成就（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 丁日夜贵酉、昼贵亥　② 贵人天将五行属土　③ 年命是占者个人落点　④ 酉亥夹拱申命，须以年命申为成立条件</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·昼夜贵人临干支拱年命格</p>\n<hr>", "q27": "<h3 id=\"例27-癸未日-二贵夹拱亥命-年命-天将-类神\">【例27】癸未日 · 二贵夹拱亥命 <code>年命</code> <code>天将</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：二贵拱年命格 · 癸未日昼占，二贵夹拱年命亥</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>癸未日</strong>白天占求官，并设占者本命或行年在<strong>亥</strong>。这次贵人不在干支上，而是直接落入初传和末传。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　妻财　贵人</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　官鬼　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">己　子孙　太阴</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>巳 → 戌 → 卯</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>癸水，干上 <strong>午</strong>、支上 <strong>子</strong>；本例另取年命 <strong>亥</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先认初末两位贵人</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：贵人天将属<strong>土</strong>、主提携。若昼贵落初传、夜贵落末传，事情从开端到结果都有贵人位置参与，比只在旁处出现更直接。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：癸日<strong>昼贵在巳、夜贵在卯</strong>。本盘初传正是巳，末传正是卯，两贵进入三传首尾。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　两贵如何夹住亥命</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：拱年命要看相对次序：一贵居年命之前为引，另一贵居年命之后为从，像前后两人共同扶持占者。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本例年命在<strong>亥</strong>，初传巳居其前、末传卯居其后，形成<strong>二贵拱亥命</strong>。因此可断求上级、求引荐容易有人共同成全。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　这盘为何求官之外也利求财</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：同一盘可以兼有不同类神，但结论要分别说明依据。贵人拱命主求官有人扶；若发用同时为财，又有后传生助，才可兼看财。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：癸属<strong>水</strong>，水克火，所以初传巳火又是癸水之财；末传卯木生巳火，木生火，等于末传助起初传之财。故原著说此课<strong>求财、求官皆吉</strong>，但求官的主因仍是二贵夹命。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：宜告贵成事，求官求财皆吉（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 癸日昼贵巳、夜贵卯　② 初末两贵进入三传首尾　③ 年命亥是格局成立条件　④ 卯木生巳火财，故兼利求财</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·二贵拱年命格</p>\n<hr>", "q28": "<h3 id=\"例28-庚午日-干支夹护夜贵-天将-课体\">【例28】庚午日 · 干支夹护夜贵 <code>天将</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：干支拱夜贵格 · 庚午日伏吟夜占，干支夹拱夜贵未</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>庚午日</strong>夜占告贵求事。天地盘伏吟不动，但日干与日支两端恰好把夜贵位置夹在中间，主静中有贵人可求。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　兄弟　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　妻财　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">己　官鬼　朱雀</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>申 → 寅 → 巳</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>庚金，干上 <strong>申</strong>、支上 <strong>午</strong>。子将子时，天地盘伏吟；庚日夜贵在 <strong>未</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　伏吟先看&quot;原位不动&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：月将与占时相同，天盘地盘原位重叠，称为<strong>伏吟</strong>。伏吟主静、守、事情不易迅速变化；求官时通常更适合守位、按既有层级求助。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘子将子时，十二支各居原位，所以干上仍是庚的寄宫<strong>申</strong>，支上仍是日支<strong>午</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　申与午正好夹着未贵</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：庚日夜贵位置在<strong>未</strong>，贵人天将五行属<strong>土</strong>。若干上、支上一前一后把贵人位夹住，叫干支拱贵，表示自己与所占之事共同围着贵人渠道。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：地支次序上，<strong>午 → 未 → 申</strong>相连；干上申、支上午，正把夜贵未夹在中间。这不是贵人临干，而是<strong>干支共同拱住贵人位</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　如何落实到告贵求事</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：干支拱贵适合请上级、长官或有资源者居中协调。伏吟又主循原路，所以宜找已有关系、原单位或原层级，不宜把希望全押在陌生新渠道。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘贵人位被干支护定，可断<strong>告贵求事吉</strong>。但伏吟节奏偏慢，做法上以守正规程序、找既有上级居中成事更符合盘意。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：宜告贵人求事，循原有渠道可成（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 月将占时相同为伏吟　② 庚日夜贵在未、贵人天将属土　③ 午未申相连，午申夹拱未贵　④ 伏吟宜守正规与既有渠道</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·干支拱夜贵格</p>\n<hr>", "q29": "<h3 id=\"例29-乙卯日-旺禄临身守为上-旬空-德合禄马\">【例29】乙卯日 · 旺禄临身守为上 <code>旬空</code> <code>德合禄马</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：旺禄临身格 · 乙卯日第二局，日禄卯临干、宜守不宜他谋</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>乙卯日</strong>来占求官谋事。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　螣蛇　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">父母　贵人　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　父母　天后</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>丑 → 子 → 亥</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>乙</strong>；干上就是 <strong>卯</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找禄</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求官看&quot;<strong>禄</strong>&quot;(俸禄/官位)。每个日干有固定禄位——甲禄寅、乙禄卯、丙戊禄巳、庚禄申、辛禄酉…</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：乙的禄在<strong>卯</strong>。这盘干上正是卯——<strong>日禄就贴在你身上(临干)</strong>，而且卯又是乙的旺气，叫&quot;旺禄临身&quot;，官位稳稳在手边。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　别舍近求远</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：禄旺临身时，最忌看着别处像有财有生就跑去追，丢了身边的禄。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘三传丑(墓)、子(脱)、亥，而且都<strong>旬空</strong>——追过去全是空的。原文&quot;到处去来，不如在此&quot;，守住干上旺禄才对。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：禄旺又临身、别处皆虚，守为上。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：守住干上的旺禄别乱动，谋为省力、自在坐用。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：切不可舍此别谋、守禄为上（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 求官看禄(俸禄官位)　② 乙禄在卯、禄临干＝禄临身　③ 禄旺临身宜守、别舍近求远　④ 三传空墓脱＝不可就</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·旺禄临身格</p>\n<hr>", "q30": "<h3 id=\"例30-辛卯日-禄虽在身却被恶将夺-天将-德合禄马\">【例30】辛卯日 · 禄虽在身却被恶将夺 <code>天将</code> <code>德合禄马</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：禄被元夺格 · 辛卯日第二局，日禄酉乘玄武/白虎被夺</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>辛卯日</strong>来占(和上一例正相反：禄也在身，却守不住)。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">己　父母　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　子孙　天空</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　子孙　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>丑 → 子 → 亥</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>辛</strong>；干上是 <strong>酉</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找禄</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：辛的禄在酉。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘干上正是<strong>酉</strong>——禄也临身，乍看和上一例(乙卯)一样好。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　但看禄上乘什么天将</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：禄临身还不够，要看它头上乘的<strong>天将</strong>吉不吉。<strong>玄武(水)</strong>是盗贼阴私、<strong>白虎(金)</strong>是血光凶信，都是凶将。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘酉禄，夜占乘<strong>玄武(水)</strong>、昼占乘<strong>白虎(金)</strong>——禄被恶将占住，像官位被小人或凶事缠住，守不安稳，叫&quot;禄被元夺&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：禄被夺、三传又墓脱，进退无着。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：禄守不住，三传丑子亥又是墓、脱，暗昧不遂。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：禄不可守、暗昧不遂</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 辛禄在酉、也临身　② 禄临身还要看所乘天将吉凶　③ 禄乘玄武/白虎凶将＝禄被夺　④ 同是禄临身，乙卯可守、辛卯被夺——差在所乘之将</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·禄被元夺格</p>\n<hr>", "q31": "<h3 id=\"例31-甲子日-禄跑到对方那边去了-德合禄马\">【例31】甲子日 · 禄跑到对方那边去了 <code>德合禄马</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：日禄临支格 · 甲子日第十一局，日禄寅加临日支子上</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲子日</strong>来占官职、差遣。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　子孙　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　官鬼　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>辰 → 午 → 申</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>甲</strong>；日支子上乘的是 <strong>寅</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找禄</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：甲的禄在寅。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：但这盘寅<strong>不在干上(自己)</strong>，而是加在<strong>日支子</strong>上——禄跑到&quot;支&quot;那边去了。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　干是我、支是他</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：六壬里<strong>日干代表自己、日支代表对方/宅</strong>。禄本该在自己(干)身上，现在却落到支(他方)上，叫&quot;日禄临支&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：禄不在自己手里、在对方那边。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：禄不由己＝当不了家。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：原文&quot;权摄不正、有名无实&quot;——像代理、寄居、或职禄被人顶替，官虽有名却不由己、受制于人。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：权摄不正、受制于人(有名无实)</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 甲禄在寅　② 干为我、支为他　③ 禄临支＝禄在对方处＝权摄不正　④ 官有名却不由己、受制于人</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·日禄临支格</p>\n<hr>", "q32": "<h3 id=\"例32-辛丑日-禄被房子压进了墓库-旺衰-德合禄马\">【例32】辛丑日 · 禄被房子压进了墓库 <code>旺衰</code> <code>德合禄马</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：禄被支墓 · 辛丑日第五局，日禄酉加支丑受墓</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>辛丑日</strong>来占官禄。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　螣蛇　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　父母　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　兄弟　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>巳 → 丑 → 酉</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>辛</strong>；日支丑上乘的是 <strong>酉</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找禄</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：辛的禄在酉。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘酉(禄)加在<strong>日支丑</strong>上——禄临支(上一例学过＝受制于人)。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　禄又被支墓收</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：更糟的是——支上的<strong>丑正是酉金的&quot;墓&quot;</strong>(金长生巳、墓在丑)。禄不但跑到支上，还被这个墓库收了进去，禄被关起来。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：禄临支已受制，又被丑墓一收，等于禄被彻底压住。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：禄被墓收＝官俸受损、难得。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：原文说这类多<strong>因起盖、房宅之事而失禄</strong>(丑为宅、为墓，把禄压住)。禄被墓收，官俸难得。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：因宅失禄、官俸受损</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 辛禄在酉　② 禄临支已是受制　③ 支丑＝酉金墓、禄被墓收　④ 多因房宅之事失禄——禄被支墓克脱</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·禄被支墓克脱格</p>\n<hr>", "q33": "<h3 id=\"例33-壬戌日-层层相生有福无畏-天将\">【例33】壬戌日 · 层层相生有福无畏 <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：支干相生格 · 壬戌日第四局，干上申生壬、支上未生申金（层层相生）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>壬戌日</strong>来占求官谋事。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　妻财　贵人</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　子孙　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　兄弟　天空</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>巳 → 寅 → 亥</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>壬</strong>；干上是 <strong>申</strong>、支上是 <strong>未</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　除了贵人、禄，还看日干被生还是被克</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求官除了看贵人、看禄，也要看日干(自己)周围是被<strong>生扶</strong>还是被<strong>克伤</strong>——被层层生扶，根基就稳。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘就看干上、支上这些字对日干壬是生是克。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　这盘是&quot;层层相生&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：顺着看一条生的链：支上 → 干上 → 日干，如果一路相生，叫&quot;<strong>支干相生</strong>&quot;，日干被接连生扶、根基厚。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看：支上<strong>未(土)</strong>生干上<strong>申(金)</strong>，干上申(金)又生日干<strong>壬(水)</strong>——<strong>未→申→壬，一路生到你身上</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　连鬼都不怕了</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：复用占病篇学的&quot;<strong>贪生忘克</strong>&quot;：一个字若能去生别的，就先去生、顾不上克。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：未土本是壬水的<strong>鬼</strong>(土克水)，但它没来克你、反而先去生了申金(贪生忘克)，再由申生你——<strong>鬼被策反成了帮手</strong>。所以原文&quot;虽未为日鬼、亦不畏&quot;，有福无畏。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：有福无畏(可作吉断)（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 求官也看日干被生被克　② 支上→干上→日干层层相生＝支干相生　③ 被层层生扶则根基厚、有福　④ 鬼贪生忘克反成帮手、鬼也不畏</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·支干相生格</p>\n<hr>", "q34": "<h3 id=\"例34-丙寅日-禄马拱身-富贵双全-天将-德合禄马-课体\">【例34】丙寅日 · 禄马拱身、富贵双全 <code>天将</code> <code>德合禄马</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：富贵课 · 丙寅日第十局(重审课)，干上申为支之驿马、支上巳为干之禄神</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙寅日</strong>来占功名官运。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　妻财　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　贵人　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　父母　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>申 → 亥 → 寅</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丙</strong>、<strong>日支</strong> 寅；干上 <strong>申</strong>、支上 <strong>巳</strong>。</p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原书只说<q class=\"yw\">丙寅日第十局，干上申乃支驿马，支上巳乃干禄</q>，<strong>没给三传</strong>。四课两处下贼上、上神都是申 → <strong>重审课</strong>发用申，中末按上神递取得亥、寅。原数据的中传<q class=\"yw\">午</q>按此盘排不出来，已改为<strong>申亥寅</strong>。</p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　求官看禄、马、贵</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求官问功名，最要紧的是&quot;<strong>禄</strong>&quot;(俸禄)、&quot;<strong>驿马</strong>&quot;(升迁走动)、&quot;<strong>贵人</strong>&quot;这几样吉神落在哪。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘专看干上、支上坐的是不是禄、马。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　马、禄正好拱在干支头上</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：&quot;<strong>驿马</strong>&quot;主升迁走动(寅午戌的马在申)，&quot;<strong>禄</strong>&quot;主俸禄(丙的禄在巳)。看它们落没落在身上。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：干上坐<strong>申</strong>——正是日支寅的<strong>驿马</strong>；支上坐<strong>巳</strong>——正是日干丙的<strong>禄神</strong>。<strong>马、禄一齐拱在干支头上</strong>，叫&quot;富贵课&quot;(真富贵卦)。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：马禄拱身＝富贵双全。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：君子占得，主加官添俸、富贵双全。（<strong>注</strong>：富贵课非人人皆吉——常人无禄马之分，占病、占讼反主凶，或主宅动身移。）</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：富贵双全(君子加官进禄)（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 求官看禄、马、贵　② 干上是支马、支上是干禄＝富贵课　③ 马禄拱身＝真富贵卦、加官添俸　④ 注意：常人占富贵课反主病讼凶</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·富贵课</p>\n<hr>", "q35": "<h3 id=\"例35-壬子日-两贵提携-天将\">【例35】⭐ 壬子日 · 两贵提携 <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：两贵引从天干格 · 壬子日昼占，初传巳乘昼贵、末传卯为夜贵位，夹拱日干</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>壬子日</strong>白天来占：我谋这个官职，有没有人帮、成不成？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　妻财　贵人</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　官鬼　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">子孙　太阴　空亡</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>巳 → 戌 → 卯</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>壬</strong>，白天占。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　求官先看谁 —— 取用神</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求官和求财不一样。求财找&quot;财&quot;；<strong>求官，最要紧的是找&quot;贵人&quot;</strong>——能提携你、替你说话的上级/贵人。（还兼看官星、青龙、太常，但先抓&quot;贵人&quot;这个主角。）</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：所以这盘我们先找：贵人在哪、站得好不好。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　认识&quot;贵人&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>贵人</strong>是十二天将之首，专主<strong>提携、扶助、解厄</strong>——求官谒贵，它就是那位帮你的人。贵人分两位：<strong>昼贵</strong>（白天占用）和<strong>夜贵</strong>（夜里占用）。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：壬日的<strong>昼贵在巳、夜贵在卯</strong>（各日干的贵人位是固定的，可查贵人表）。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　看这盘贵人怎么站</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：找到贵人位，就看它们和日干（你自己）的位置关系——围着你、朝着你，就是向着你、肯帮你。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看三传：<strong>初传正是巳（昼贵位）、末传正是卯（夜贵位）</strong>，一前一后把日干壬夹在当中——这叫&quot;<strong>两贵引从</strong>&quot;。好比两位贵人一左一右护着你、前后照应，提携之象十足。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：必得上人提携、两贵引荐成事（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 求官取用神以&quot;贵人&quot;为主（兼官星/青龙/太常）　② 贵人＝十二天将之首、主提携　③ 贵人分昼贵夜贵、按昼夜占取　④ 两贵夹拱日干＝贵人引从提携</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·两贵引从天干格</p>\n<hr>", "q36": "<h3 id=\"例36-辛丑日-层层举荐-旬空-年命-天将-递生递克\">【例36】⭐ 辛丑日 · 层层举荐 <code>旬空</code> <code>年命</code> <code>天将</code> <code>递生递克</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：递生格 · 辛丑日第十一局，卯生巳、巳生未、未生日干辛（得人举荐·中传巳空）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>辛丑日</strong>来占求官：这次有没有人举荐我？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　妻财　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　天后　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　父母　螣蛇</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>卯 → 巳 → 未</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>辛</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　看三传是&quot;生&quot;还是&quot;克&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财篇学过三传&quot;<strong>递克</strong>&quot;（一路克下去、层层归我，得财）。求官正相反，最喜三传&quot;<strong>递生</strong>&quot;——一路相生。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看这盘：卯生巳、巳生未、未生辛干——<strong>一层层生到你（日干辛）身上</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　递生＝有人举荐</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：三传层层相生、最后生到日干，象<strong>有人隔三隔四、一级级把你往上推荐</strong>、得贵人扶持。原文说：&quot;必隔三隔四有人于上位推荐之意&quot;。所以递生是求官的大吉之象。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：照这个象，这次求官是有人肯举荐你的。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　别急 —— 回头看空亡</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财篇的&quot;空亡&quot;这里又用上了：<strong>递生虽好，还得看中间那一环空不空</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：偏偏这盘中传 <strong>巳恰好空亡</strong>（辛丑属甲午旬、空辰巳）。举荐的&quot;中间环节&quot;空了，等于<strong>有人想举荐、却一时落实不了</strong>（&quot;有举荐之心、无举荐之实&quot;）。除非你的<strong>本命／行年</strong>正好落在巳上把这个空位&quot;<strong>填实</strong>&quot;，举荐才真正落地。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：得人举荐（中空则须本命/行年填实方成）（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 三传递生日干＝有人层层举荐（与求财&quot;递克&quot;相反）　② 递生是求官大吉　③ 中间一环空亡＝举荐落空　④ 本命/行年&quot;填实&quot;空位则可成</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·递生格</p>\n<hr>", "q37": "<h3 id=\"例37-丁巳日-干支拱禄-天将-德合禄马-课体\">【例37】⭐ 丁巳日 · 干支拱禄 <code>天将</code> <code>德合禄马</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：干支拱定日禄格 · 丁巳日伏吟，干上未、支上巳夹拱日禄午</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丁巳日</strong>来占前程、食禄（官俸）之事。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　兄弟　天空</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　妻财　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　父母　六合</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>巳 → 申 → 寅</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丁</strong>（此为&quot;伏吟&quot;课，天地盘不动、主静）。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　求官还看一个字：&quot;禄&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求官除了看贵人，还要看&quot;<strong>禄</strong>&quot;。禄就是你的<strong>俸禄、官位、饭碗</strong>——每个日干有自己固定的禄位（丁的禄在<strong>午</strong>）。禄旺、禄不空、禄有护，主有官俸前程。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：所以这盘先找日禄午，看它处境好不好。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　这盘的禄被&quot;夹护&quot;住了</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：看禄位左右两边是什么——被吉神一前一后夹着护着，就是&quot;饭碗被护牢&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看盘：干上是未、支上是巳，<strong>未和巳一前一后，正好把日禄午夹在中间</strong>（这叫&quot;干支拱禄&quot;）。好比你的饭碗被左右两边护着、稳稳当当，前程有靠。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　顺带认一个课体：&quot;伏吟&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：这课是&quot;<strong>伏吟</strong>&quot;——天盘地盘不动、叠在一起，象<strong>事情静止、守成、就位不动</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：占&quot;前程、食禄&quot;这类&quot;守着位子、按部就班&quot;的事，遇伏吟正相宜——安稳在其位。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：宜占前程、食禄之事（禄位稳固）（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 求官看&quot;禄&quot;＝俸禄/官位/饭碗　② 每个日干有固定禄位（丁禄在午）　③ 干支夹拱日禄＝饭碗被护、前程有靠　④ 伏吟主静、宜占就位守成</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·干支拱定日禄格</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote class=\"star\"><p>⭐ <strong>以下出自《大六壬通解》下册<q class=\"yw\">历代六壬课例</q></strong>——出处可按页码逐句回查，盘为复算并与原书三传交叉验证过。</p></blockquote>", "q38": "<h3 id=\"例38-乙丑日-上任挑日子-先看这天的纳音克不克你-年命-应期-六亲\">【例38】乙丑日 · 上任挑日子，先看这天的纳音克不克你 <code>年命</code> <code>应期</code> <code>六亲</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：重审课 · 正月乙丑日亥将寅时 · 三传丑戌未皆财，行年巳上得功曹</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：正月<strong>乙丑日</strong>寅时<strong>上官</strong>（赴任就职）——这个日子选得好不好。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 择日上官歌诀 / 纳音不可克行年上神 / 官克年上神则凶，凶应在该五行当旺之月</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　妻财　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　朱雀　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　妻财　天后</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：上任者<strong>行年在巳</strong>，<strong>巳上得功曹（寅）</strong>；拜官之日<strong>乙丑</strong>，<strong>纳音属金</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先记住这条择日歌诀</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>择日上官何所从，年上神遭官克凶，兵法二曹金是主，土曹为木水司空，户属火宫仓在土，水来伤火害于冬。</strong></q>&lt;br&gt;核心一句：<strong>拜官那天的纳音，不能克你行年上的那个字</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本例上任者<strong>行年巳、巳上是寅（功曹）</strong>——寅属<strong>木</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　再看这一天的纳音是什么</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：看的不是日干支的五行，而是<strong>纳音</strong>五行。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>乙丑日纳音属金</strong>，原文称之为<q class=\"yw\"><strong>金曹</strong></q>。金正克寅木 ⇒ <strong>官克行年上神</strong> ⇒ 按歌诀断<strong>凶</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　凶应在什么时候：那一行当旺之时</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：克是克了，但发作要等<strong>克我的那一行当令</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：金<strong>到秋方旺</strong> ⇒ 断<q class=\"yw\">当忧<strong>七月八月</strong>有凶</q>。⭐ 这条思路与占病定应期完全一样：<strong>先看谁克谁，再看克的那一方几时得令</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">其人行年立巳，上得功曹，拜官之日乙丑，纳音属金，谓之金曹，正谓<strong>官克行年上神</strong>，金曹到秋方旺，当忧七月八月有凶也。</q>&lt;br&gt;叶注：<q class=\"yw\">择日上官，古人有云：『<strong>择日上官何所从，年上神遭官克凶</strong>，兵法二曹金是主，土曹为木水司空，户属火宫仓在土，水来伤火害于冬。』<strong>拜官之日，纳音不能伤克行年上神。</strong></q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：行年巳上是寅木（我的年上神）＋拜官日乙丑纳音属金（金曹）＋金克寅木（年上神遭官克·凶）＋金旺于秋（应在七八月）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：这个日子不宜上任——日之纳音金克行年上神寅木，凶应在七、八月</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 择日上官看纳音，不看日干支五行　② 纳音不可克行年上神　③ 应期取克方当令之月　④ 同一套思路可移到别的择日上</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例十（择日上官，《通神集》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p84｜PDF p816〕</span></p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote class=\"star\"><p>⭐ <strong>以下出自《大六壬通解》下册<q class=\"yw\">历代六壬课例</q></strong>——出处可按页码逐句回查，盘为复算并与原书三传交叉验证过。</p></blockquote>", "q39": "<h3 id=\"例39-丙寅日-占前程-却先断出-要克四个妻子-六亲-年命-应期-德合禄马\">【例39】⭐ 丙寅日 · 占前程，却先断出<q class=\"yw\">要克四个妻子</q> <code>六亲</code> <code>年命</code> <code>应期</code> <code>德合禄马</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：涉害（复等）· 丙寅日亥将申时 · 三传申亥寅皆四孟，申为妻从日上发用、亥空亡</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：建炎戊申年<strong>丙寅日</strong>申时，徐教授（戊子命，二十一岁）来占<strong>前程</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 问前程先答六亲 / 妻星从日上发用又空＝克妻，数取类神之数 / 日马四孟＝劳碌而富贵 / 禄坐长生定发达之年 / 末传取职务性质</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　妻财　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　贵人　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　父母　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>申为妻</strong>（丙日之财），<strong>从日上发用</strong>、又<strong>空亡临妻宫</strong>；<strong>三传</strong> <strong>申 → 亥 → 寅</strong> 全是<strong>四孟（寅申巳亥四维）</strong>；日禄<strong>巳加寅</strong>受生；末传<strong>寅</strong>是<strong>功曹</strong>、临<strong>天门</strong>乘<strong>玄武</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 问的是前程，先答的却是妻子</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：六壬不按你问的顺序答——<strong>盘上什么最扎眼就先说什么</strong>。妻星从日上发用、又落空，这比前程更急。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">申本时临日，为日所克，丙为夫，<strong>申为妻</strong>，既从日上发用，<strong>空亡又临妻宫，目下主克妻</strong></q>⇒ 先断当下就要丧妻。后果：次年五月妻楊氏卒。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　克几个：用类神之数</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：数目取<strong>类神之数</strong>。水一、火二、木三、金四、土五；此外<strong>亥数亦为四</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：申的阴神是<strong>亥</strong>，<strong>亥数四</strong> ⇒ 断<q class=\"yw\"><strong>主克四妻</strong></q>。后来果然：楊氏卒→娶李氏→李氏亡→娶毛氏→毛氏卒→再娶江氏，前后<strong>四位</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　再答前程：日马、四孟、禄坐长生</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>日马</strong>主奔走，<strong>四孟（四维）</strong>主<q class=\"yw\">代天子而守四方</q>；发达之期看<strong>日禄</strong>坐在什么上、以及那个字的数。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>申为今日之马</strong>、三传<strong>寅申巳亥四维皆是</strong> ⇒ 断<strong>年高历任、至老不倦</strong>、必四任；日禄<strong>巳加寅</strong>（禄身遇长生）⇒ 事业发达；<strong>巳数四</strong> ⇒ 断<strong>四十岁以后</strong>方显。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　靠谁显达、做什么官：一个字兼三层</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>寅</strong>在这一课里同时是：月建得令、本命马星、以及<strong>功曹</strong>——一个字兼三层，断语就落得极实。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：寅为<strong>月建</strong>又是本命马 ⇒ 断<q class=\"yw\"><strong>将四旬必遇曹姓人而显官</strong></q>；末传<strong>寅为功曹</strong> ⇒ <q class=\"yw\">终于<strong>六曹</strong></q>；<strong>寅临天门</strong>、乘<strong>玄武</strong>（黑煞、主刑）⇒ 所任<strong>带刑职</strong>。后果：由曹球（秦太师上客）荐举入京，官至监察御史、殿中侍郎、吏部侍郎。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第⑤步　几时开始起来：初传之数</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：升迁的节奏取<strong>初传之数</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>申数四</strong> ⇒ 四年之后显贵；中传<strong>亥虽空亡，但它是月将，不论空</strong>——只是<strong>略迟</strong>而已。后果：四年后由诸王府教授出为饶州通判，一路而上，八十六岁仍在任。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">申本时临日，为日所克，丙为夫，申为妻，既从日上发用，空亡又临妻宫，<strong>目下主克妻，亥数四，主克四妻</strong>……<strong>将四旬必遇曹姓人而显官，亦终于六曹</strong>……中传亥乃月将，<strong>不论空亡，但时少迟耳</strong>……寅申巳亥为四维，主代天子而守四方，必四任也。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：申为妻从日上发用又空临妻宫（目下克妻）＋亥数四（克四妻）＋日马＋三传四孟（历任四方·至老不倦）＋日禄巳加寅长生·巳数四（四十后发达）＋寅为月建·功曹·临天门乘玄武（遇曹姓显官·终于六曹带刑职）＋申数四（四年后起）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：当下就要丧妻，一生克四妻；四十岁后遇曹姓人举荐而显达，四年一升，官带刑职、终于六曹，至老不倦</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 问前程，盘上更急的事先答　② 妻星发用又空＝克妻；数取类神之数　③ 日马＋四孟＝历任四方　④ 禄坐长生定发达、其数定年岁　⑤ 月将虽空不论空，只主迟</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例三（邵彦和占徐教授前程）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p120｜PDF p852〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q40": "<h3 id=\"例40-己卯日-铸印乘轩的好格-为什么反断功名不成-天将-课体-类神-取象\">【例40】⭐ 己卯日 · 铸印乘轩的好格，为什么反断功名不成 <code>天将</code> <code>课体</code> <code>类神</code> <code>取象</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：比用课（铸印乘轩）· 己卯日午将丑时 · 巳作玄武加子为<q class=\"yw\">走范</q>，卯作白虎加戌为<q class=\"yw\">破模</q></p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：己酉年六月<strong>己卯日</strong>丑时，应秀才（癸酉生，三十七岁）占<strong>前程</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 七杀元辰歌诀 / 好格也会被坏（走范·破模）/ 空话空指＝指空话空 / 卯为车轿——断出死法</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　父母　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　兄弟　朱雀</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">己　官鬼　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：课名<strong>铸印乘轩</strong>（本是吉格）；但发用<strong>巳作玄武加子</strong>（上火下水）、<strong>卯作白虎加戌</strong>；命主<strong>七杀元辰</strong>在盘上得势。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 先断这个人的心性：七杀元辰</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>元辰</strong>（又名毛头星、大耗）有一首歌诀：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>鼠忌羊头上，牛嗔马不耕。虎憎鸡喙短，兔怨猴不平。龙嫌猪面黑，蛇惊犬吠声。</strong></q>元辰处在冲位之侧、避开正位，<strong>为人为事不正、动摇颠倒</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本课七杀元辰当令 ⇒ 断此人<q class=\"yw\"><strong>心术多且又毒</strong></q><q class=\"yw\">凡所行所为，皆是<strong>妒忌之心，好管是非，好谈人短，所以灭前程也</strong></q>。⭐ 原文点明：<strong>占前程遇元辰，多主妒忌</strong>——心性本身就是前程的障碍。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　再看那些<q class=\"yw\">看起来有、其实没有</q>的</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：身宅上纵有贵人，也要看它<strong>实不实</strong>：作勾陈则被牵绊，落空亡则是虚的。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">身宅虽皆有贵人，而<strong>子作勾陈、申作空亡</strong>，谓之『<strong>指空话空</strong>』</q>——嘴上说的都是空的；初传<strong>破碎乘玄武</strong>又是<strong>驿马</strong> ⇒ <q class=\"yw\">面东指西、走南奔北，多图多觅之人</q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　⭐ 吉格被坏：走范与破模</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>铸印乘轩</strong>本是贵格（铸印＝制印、乘轩＝坐车得位）。但铸印要有<strong>范（模子）</strong>、乘轩要有<strong>轩（车）</strong>——把这两样坏掉，格就成空壳。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>巳作玄武加子</strong>，上火下水，玄武为贼 ⇒ <q class=\"yw\">谓之<strong>走范</strong></q>（模子跑了，印铸不成）；<strong>卯作白虎加戌</strong> ⇒ <q class=\"yw\">谓之<strong>破模</strong></q>，虎又伤卯 ⇒ <q class=\"yw\">为<strong>坠轩</strong></q>（车翻了）⇒ 故断<strong>功名不成</strong>。⭐ 记住这个思路：<strong>格是由几个零件搭起来的，看谁把零件拆了。</strong></li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　最后一断：连怎么死的都说了</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>卯为车轿驴骡</strong>；再看日干在这个字上的十二长生——<strong>己土死于卯</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">且防<strong>覆坠骑乘</strong>之患也</q>⇒ 后至壬戌年二月，因争役<strong>乘轿入城、坠轿折足</strong>，血气上攻而死。原文补一句关键限定：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>支辰最紧，若非己卯日，不可言死</strong></q>——同样的象，换个日辰就不能断到死。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">课主吾兄心术多且又毒，以<strong>鼠忌羊头上</strong>……凡所行所为，皆是妒忌之心，好管是非，好谈人短，<strong>所以灭前程也</strong>……<strong>铸印乘轩之课，巳作玄武加子，上火下水，玄武为贼，谓之走范。卯作白虎加戌，谓之破模。虎伤卯，又为坠轩，故主功名不成。</strong>且防覆坠骑乘之患也……盖卯为车轿驴骡，己土死于卯，<strong>支辰最紧，若非己卯日，不可言死</strong>。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：七杀元辰得势（心术妒忌·自灭前程）＋贵人作勾陈·申空亡（指空话空）＋巳玄武加子走范·卯白虎加戌破模（铸印乘轩成空壳·功名不成）＋卯为车轿·己土死于卯（坠轿而亡）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：功名成不了——心性妒忌自坏前程，吉格又被走范破模；且要防车轿倾覆之祸（后果坠轿折足而死）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 元辰歌诀断心性，心性也能灭前程　② 贵人落空＝指空话空　③ ⭐ 吉格看零件有没有被拆（走范·破模）　④ 卯为车轿；断到死要有日辰的硬条件</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例七（邵彦和占应秀才前程）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p125｜PDF p857〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q41": "<h3 id=\"例41-丁卯日-三传递生像是有人举荐-为什么升不了-课体-年命-旬空-墓神\">【例41】⭐ 丁卯日 · 三传递生像是有人举荐，为什么升不了 <code>课体</code> <code>年命</code> <code>旬空</code> <code>墓神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：重审课（闭口）· 丁卯日辰将丑时 · 三传酉子卯递生，但旬首落酉为闭口，年命俱空</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：乾隆丙子年九月<strong>丁卯日</strong>丑时，都转卢雅雨（辛未生，六十六岁）占<strong>能不能升迁</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 三传递生≠一定有举荐 / 闭口课＝生我而不得其生 / ⭐<q class=\"yw\">三传是大概之象，年命方切于己</q>/ 日上临墓又与支合＝脱不了身</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　妻财　贵人</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　官鬼　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　父母　天空</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>酉 → 子 → 卯</strong> 一路<strong>递生</strong>；但甲子<strong>旬首落在地盘酉上</strong>，成<strong>闭口</strong>；本人<strong>年、命皆空</strong>；日上临<strong>戊墓</strong>，墓又与日支<strong>卯戌相合</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　卢公自己的读法：递生＝有人举荐</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：三传递生，常法读作<q class=\"yw\">一层层生上来</q>，占官职多主<strong>有人举荐</strong>。卢雅雨本人也懂六壬，当场就这么问。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">三传递生人举荐，何故不能？</q>——这一步没错，错在只用了这一层。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　⭐ 王牧夫的第一层反驳：闭口</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：本课<strong>旬首落在地盘酉</strong>上，是<strong>闭口课</strong>。闭口者，<strong>生我者不得其生</strong>——话说不出口、事情摆不上台面。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>递生虽属举荐，但是闭口不能显荐</strong></q>⇒ 有人想帮，但荐不到明处。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　⭐ 第二层，也是最该记的一句：年命才切己</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>三传是大概之象，年命方切于己耳。</strong></q>——三传讲的是这件事的大势，<strong>落到<q class=\"yw\">我本人</q>得看年命</strong>。年命空，事就落不到自己身上。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本人<strong>年、命皆空</strong>（本命未上神为戊临空亡）⇒ <q class=\"yw\">不能着实</q>⇒ 升迁的好处到不了他头上。⭐ 这一句可以直接搬去用在任何一课上。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　为什么又确实动了心：丁神与冲</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>丁神</strong>主异动、心动身动；初末<strong>卯酉相冲</strong>是门户之冲——心是真动了。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>丁神心动身动，实有所望</strong>，奈<strong>自乘墓</strong>，又与支神作合</q>⇒ 想动而动不了。日上临<strong>戊墓</strong>、墓又与日支<strong>卯戌牢合</strong> ⇒ <strong>脱不了墓</strong> ⇒ 断<strong>不能升迁，安荣此任甚久</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第⑤步　后来怎么收的场</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：末传的落点常常就是结局所在。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：末传<strong>卯上临午</strong>：卯为<strong>宅</strong>、午为<strong>日禄</strong> ⇒ <strong>日禄入宅</strong>＝告老还乡。后果：壬午年冬<strong>告休而回</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">『不能升迁，安荣此任甚久。』公曰：『三传递生人举荐，何故不能？』曰：『<strong>递生虽属举荐，但是闭口不能显荐</strong>，况<strong>公年命皆空，不能着实，三传是大概之象，年命方切于己耳</strong>。且丁神心动身动，实有所望，奈自乘墓，又与支神作合，所以安荣此任不能升迁者也。』</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：三传递生（像有人举荐）＋旬首落酉为闭口（荐不到明处）＋年命俱空（好处落不到自己身上）＋日上乘墓又与支合（脱不了身）＋末传卯上临午·日禄入宅（壬午年告老还乡）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：升不了，会在这个位子上待很久；后于壬午年冬告老还乡</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 递生＝举荐只是常法，还要看能不能显　② 闭口课＝生我者不得其生　③ ⭐<q class=\"yw\">三传是大概之象，年命方切于己</q>　④ 乘墓又与支合＝脱不了身　⑤ 末传落点＝结局</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例六十一（王牧夫占卢雅雨迁官否，《牧夫占验》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p159｜PDF p891〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q42": "<h3 id=\"例42-戊辰日-名家也会断错-这一课郭御青错在哪-年命-旬空-课体-取象\">【例42】⭐ 戊辰日 · 名家也会断错：这一课郭御青错在哪 <code>年命</code> <code>旬空</code> <code>课体</code> <code>取象</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：遥克（弹射）· 戊辰日未将辰时 · 三传亥寅巳，初中空亡、课不行传</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：崇祯丁丑年五月<strong>戊辰日</strong>辰时，山西姚昌祚占<strong>自己会被派到哪里任职</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 常法失效时会怎样 / 课不行传就不能以三传定论 / 四课暗拱之字 / ⭐ 名家的自我复盘</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　朱雀　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　官鬼　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">己　父母　太常</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>亥 → 寅 → 巳</strong>，<strong>初、中两传空亡</strong>；行年加<strong>申</strong>；四课上神为<strong>未、申、戌、亥</strong>，中间<strong>暗拱一个酉</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　郭御青当时怎么断的</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占任所的常法：看<strong>行年所临</strong>、<strong>官星</strong>、<strong>驿马</strong>的分野。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：天上行年加<strong>申</strong>＝山西分野，但求测者本就是山西人、当时官制不许选本省 ⇒ 舍去；发用<strong>亥为卫地</strong>、亥上临<strong>寅</strong>（日之官鬼兼驿马）、日禄<strong>巳加寅</strong>（寅为燕分）⇒ 断<q class=\"yw\"><strong>非卫即燕</strong></q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　结果错了：选的是新野（周分）</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">后选新野周分，<strong>传课全无影响</strong></q>——用上的几条常法，一条都没对上。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：⭐ 原书<strong>如实记下这个错</strong>，并留下一句：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>课体隐现无穷，执一便谬。</strong></q></li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　郭御青自己的复盘：四课暗拱</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：他反复琢磨数日后，找到的解释是：<strong>不看三传，看四课暗拱出来的字</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：四课上神<strong>未、申、戌、亥</strong>，中间<strong>暗拱一个酉</strong>，<strong>酉加午</strong>，午为<strong>周分</strong> ⇒ 新野正属周。他补了一句边界：<q class=\"yw\">此断在官禄马行年之外……后遇占任所又不必尽照此法也。</q></li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　⭐ 叶注给出的课理：课不行传，就别用三传</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：这才是这一例真正的收获——<strong>什么时候三传不能用</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">实际上此课<strong>行传空亡，课不行传，因此不能以三传定论</strong>。初中空亡不行，到末传好不容易出现了不空亡的<strong>巳</strong>，却被亥水冲破，但它毕竟不空，因此<strong>前行一位到午</strong>，此当为课理。</q>&lt;br&gt;⚠️ 叶注同时提醒：其他类象（未为野、太阳初到未为<q class=\"yw\">新</q>，凑成<q class=\"yw\">新野</q>）虽也说得通，<strong><q class=\"yw\">不无取巧之弊</q></strong>——事后往结果上凑的解释，不能当方法学。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">余初断非卫即燕，后选新野周分，<strong>传课全无影响</strong>。余后详课情数日夜，乃得之。盖<strong>四课暗拱地盘周地也</strong>。此断在官禄马行年之外……<strong>课体隐现无穷，执一便谬。</strong></q>&lt;br&gt;叶注：<q class=\"yw\">此课<strong>行传空亡，课不行传，因此不能以三传定论</strong>……其他类象固然能取，<strong>不无取巧之弊</strong>。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：常法（行年·官星·驿马分野）断卫或燕→全错＋初中空亡·课不行传（三传本就不能用）＋末传巳被冲而前行一位到午·四课暗拱酉加午（周分·新野）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：（原断<q class=\"yw\">非卫即燕</q>错）实际任所在新野，属周分</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① ⭐ 常法有失效的时候，<q class=\"yw\">执一便谬</q>　② 初中空亡、课不行传时，不能以三传定论　③ 四课暗拱之字可用　④ ⚠️ 事后凑结果的解释不能当方法学　⑤ 名家的错课比对课更值得读</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例六十五（郭御青占任所——一个断错的课）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p162｜PDF p894〕</span></p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote class=\"star\"><p>⭐ <strong>以下出自《大六壬通解》下册<q class=\"yw\">历代六壬课例</q></strong>——出处可按页码逐句回查，盘为复算并与原书三传交叉验证过。</p></blockquote>", "q43": "<h3 id=\"例43-壬辰日-乱首课-受贿-妻被仆辱-死于仆手-全断中了-课体-天将-六亲-墓神\">【例43】⭐ 壬辰日 · 乱首课：受贿、妻被仆辱、死于仆手，全断中了 <code>课体</code> <code>天将</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>墓神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：涉害（复等）· 壬辰日寅将未时 · 课名乱首（亥加辰、下犯上），三传午丑申</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：戊申年十一月<strong>壬辰日</strong>未时，徐通判（戊午生，五十一岁）占<strong>赴任与前程</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 乱首课＝下犯上 / 官加财上＝在任受贿 / 妻财临天空之上＝仆辱其妻 / 父墓玄武拒尸（六壬里的风水断）/ ⭐ 占师的分寸</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　天后　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">己　官鬼　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　父母　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：课名<strong>乱首</strong>（<strong>亥加辰</strong>，下犯上）；<strong>丑为官加在午（财）上</strong>；<strong>亥作天空为仆</strong>，<strong>午财作天后为妻</strong>、正<strong>临于天空之上</strong>；壬以<strong>申为父</strong>、<strong>加丑是父墓</strong>，玄武<strong>长生刚硬而不垂头</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 先说邵彦和当场怎么处理的</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：断出大凶而当事人还要赴任时，占师的处置很讲究：<strong>不明言，只给能救的话和能做的事</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">予详此课，<strong>不便明言。惟以廉洁二字勉之</strong>。并嘱其<strong>慎用奴仆，宜修父坟</strong>而已。</q>——退下来才对门人讲实情。⭐ 这一层比断法本身更该学：<strong>说什么、对谁说、留几分</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　课体先定性：乱首＝下犯上</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>乱首</strong>是下神克上神、以卑凌尊的课体，占官职最忌——主<strong>手底下的人反过来挟制你</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>亥加辰</strong>，正是<q class=\"yw\"><strong>自取乱首</strong></q>；<strong>将得天空</strong>（天空为仆）⇒ <q class=\"yw\"><strong>仆犯主也</strong></q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　受贿从哪看：官加在财上</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>丑为官（官职）</strong>、<strong>午为财</strong>。官坐在财上，就是<q class=\"yw\">拿官职去换钱</q>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>丑官加午财上，故在任受贿</strong></q>。后果：徐权州事时，一妇人打死婢女，他收二千贯从轻发落。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　妻的事：财作天后，却临天空之上</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>天后主妻、亦主淫乱</strong>；<strong>天空为仆</strong>。妻的字<strong>压在仆的字上面</strong>，位置本身就说明了关系。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>亥作天空为仆，财作天后为妻子，临于天空之上，故主仆淫其妻</strong>，天后又主淫乱也。</q>后果：仆童吉持二十千挟制其主，遂奸其妻，徐知而不敢明责。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第⑤步　父坟：六壬也能断风水</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：壬以<strong>申为父</strong>，申<strong>加丑</strong>是<strong>父墓</strong>；再看那个位置上的<strong>玄武</strong>（北方、来龙）状态——<strong>长生刚硬而不垂头</strong>，即来龙不肯低头结穴。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：断<q class=\"yw\"><strong>其父墓玄武不垂头，拒尸之故</strong>。若速移此坟，可保佑性命</q>。后核：其父墓坎山，玄武七十余丈而葬在六十丈，前面还有十余丈，<strong>果不垂头</strong>。&lt;br&gt;（叶注：<strong>玄武拒尸</strong>＝墓后来龙尽头不自然下降或昂首他去，寻不到正穴。）</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第⑥步　最后的应期与死法</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>午亥俱自刑</strong>，壬（寄亥）又受<strong>辰土天空夹克</strong>，乱首下犯上 ⇒ 死于仆手；年份取戊午。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">否则<strong>戊午年必见凶矣</strong></q>。后果：乙卯调池州通判，不带此仆；<strong>戊午年仆到池州</strong>，次日持刀刺杀徐于门中。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">此课名乱首，通判日后因在任中受贿，为仆所持，妻被仆奸淫，本身则死于仆手。<strong>其父墓玄武不垂头，拒尸之故。若速移此坟，可保佑性命</strong>，否则戊午年必见凶矣……亥加辰，乃自取乱首。将得天空，仆犯主也。午为财，丑为官，<strong>丑官加午财上，故在任受贿</strong>。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：乱首（亥加辰·下犯上）＋天空为仆犯主＋丑官加午财（在任受贿）＋天后妻临天空之上（仆辱其妻）＋申父加丑为父墓·玄武不垂头（拒尸）＋午亥自刑·壬受夹克（戊午年死于仆手）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：在任受贿、被仆挟制、妻被仆所辱，戊午年死于仆手；父坟玄武拒尸，速移可保命</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① ⭐ 断出大凶而人要赴任时，只给能救的话（廉洁、慎仆、修坟）　② 乱首＝下犯上　③ 官加财上＝受贿　④ 妻的字压在仆的字上＝主仆之乱　⑤ 六壬可断祖坟：玄武不垂头＝拒尸</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例二十九（邵彦和占徐通判赴任及前程）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p139｜PDF p871〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q44": "<h3 id=\"例44-戊申日-求这个官要-先费自己的钱-还中了魁首-六亲-天将-墓神-课体\">【例44】戊申日 · 求这个官要<q class=\"yw\">先费自己的钱</q>，还中了魁首 <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code> <code>墓神</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：重审课 · 戊申日酉将丑时 · 三传子申辰合水局（漕司之局），末传辰归宅、为甲辰旬魁首</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：建炎己酉年四月初一<strong>戊申日</strong>丑时，邓十八官人占<strong>能不能得漕司之职</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：土日得财局＝以财求官 / 昼贵作天空＝帘幕贵人 / 宅上玄武＝不正之途 / ⭐ 魁星（科名贵）/ ⭐ 墓与库之辨：生处为库、死处为墓</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　妻财　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　子孙　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　兄弟　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>子 → 申 → 辰</strong> 合成<strong>申子辰水局</strong>——戊土以水为财，而<strong>漕司正是申子辰之局</strong>；身上<strong>昼贵作天空</strong>；宅上<strong>玄武</strong>；末传<strong>辰归宅</strong>，且是<strong>甲辰旬</strong>的<strong>魁首</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　这个官为什么要用财去求</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>土日得财局</strong>，而所求的这个职位本身<strong>正是这个财局</strong>——那就不能把财当外物，得<strong>拿财去换</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">土日得财局，<strong>须是用财为之却吉</strong>。漕司正是申子辰水局也。既以漕司为财，<strong>须费己财为佳</strong>。</q>⇒ 断这官须<strong>破费自己的钱</strong>才成。后果<q class=\"yw\">其所费不可言</q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　靠谁：昼贵作天空＝帘幕贵人</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>贵人</strong>主提携；它<strong>作天空</strong>时不是坏了，而是转成<strong>帘幕之贵</strong>（幕后、内线的贵人）。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">身上是昼贵作天空，主<strong>帘幕贵人，驰声于我，我遂得功名也</strong>。</q></li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　路子正不正：宅上玄武</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>玄武主不正、主暗中</strong>。它落在<strong>宅上</strong>，就是自家这一路走的是暗门。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">宅上玄武，是<strong>本局作贼</strong>，须<strong>三换名字，及换卷子，并令人代之</strong>，此所以<strong>不正中</strong>也。</q>——后来果然听说有关节、有易卷之说。⭐ 六壬不避讳断这类事，但断的是<strong>象</strong>，不替人下道德结论。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　⭐ 名次：魁星（科名贵）</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：《广信集》：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>自甲辰至癸丑一旬，俱是在日时上，无不及第，两三位者必作前名。</strong></q>以<strong>甲辰、丁未、庚戌、癸丑</strong>为真魁星。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>甲辰旬十日，皆是魁星，故主魁首也</strong></q>；末传归宅是<strong>辰</strong>，正是甲辰旬之魁首 ⇒ 断中<strong>经魁</strong>。后果：本年中经魁；次年省试不中，却试了弓马，得明州象山县税务。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第⑤步　⭐ 顺带一条最该记的：墓与库怎么分</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">凡<strong>墓与库二名而同体</strong>，何以分别？盖<strong>生处为库，死处为墓</strong>。</q></li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：戊土以辰为库；<strong>辰土生于申</strong>，本课辰正落在申上 ⇒ 是<strong>真库</strong>（不是墓）⇒ 主<strong>有钱谷、掌仓储</strong>。又<strong>天罡（辰）为鱼盐之物</strong> ⇒ 断所任兼<strong>煎盐</strong>。后果：得税务、监务兼煎盐，一一应验。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">土日得财局，须是用财为之却吉……既以漕司为财，<strong>须费己财为佳</strong>……<strong>甲辰旬十日，皆是魁星，故主魁首也</strong>……盖戊土以辰为库。<strong>辰土生于申，乃真库也。凡墓与库二名而同体，何以分别？盖生处为库，死处为墓。</strong>今辰生于申，实为真库。<strong>天罡为鱼盐之物</strong>，故监务兼煎盐也。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：土日得财局而漕司正是此局（须费己财去求）＋身上昼贵作天空（帘幕贵人助）＋宅上玄武（走的不是正途）＋甲辰旬皆魁星·末传辰归宅（中经魁）＋辰生于申为真库·天罡为鱼盐（掌钱谷兼煎盐）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：这官求得到，但要先破费自己的钱、且走的不是正途；当年中经魁，后得税务、监务兼煎盐</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 所求之职就是那个局时，须用财去换　② 昼贵作天空＝帘幕贵人　③ 宅上玄武＝路子不正　④ 魁星（甲辰旬）＝名次　⑤ ⭐ 生处为库、死处为墓</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例五十三（邵彦和占邓十八官人漕司）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p155｜PDF p887〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q45": "<h3 id=\"例45-癸亥日-会被派到哪个县-盘上拱出一个地名-年命-类神-取象-德合禄马\">【例45】⭐ 癸亥日 · 会被派到哪个县？盘上拱出一个地名 <code>年命</code> <code>类神</code> <code>取象</code> <code>德合禄马</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：元首课 · 癸亥日辰将丑时 · 三传辰未戌皆土，官星为用临丑，干支上神暗拱子地</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：崇祯丁丑年八月<strong>癸亥日</strong>丑时，真定（燕地）人刘梦言占<strong>自己会被派到哪里做官</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 占任所的分野法 / 排除法：本地不选 / 干支上神暗拱之字 / 从字取地名（卯为草头）/ ⭐ 附古法：本命禄神下辰为分野</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　官鬼　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">己　官鬼　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　官鬼　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>天上行年临酉</strong>（酉为赵分）；<strong>官星为用临丑</strong>（丑为吴越）；<strong>驿马不入传、又临寅</strong>（寅为燕分）；<strong>干支上神暗拱地盘子</strong>（子为山东）。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先记分野对照：地支就是地名</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占任所的底子是<strong>分野</strong>：<strong>寅为燕、酉为赵、丑为吴越、子为山东</strong>……先把盘上几个关键字翻成地名。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：行年临<strong>酉</strong>＝赵地（求测者本是真定人，属燕，赵地紧邻）；官星临<strong>丑</strong>＝吴越；驿马临<strong>寅</strong>＝燕。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　⭐ 再用排除法：本地与不可能的地方先划掉</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：分野翻出来还不算完，要<strong>结合当时的官制与人情</strong>排除。这一步是<strong>事理</strong>，不是术数。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">据此课，天上行年临酉，<strong>岂赵人选赵地乎</strong>？官星为用临丑，<strong>北人难得吴越</strong>，驿马不在传，又临燕，<strong>亦本地也</strong>。</q>——三条候选全被排除。⭐ 与例42（郭御青断错的那一课）对照着看：<strong>常法给出的候选未必是答案，得先过事理这一关。</strong></li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　⭐ 常法排完了，就看四课暗拱出什么</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：三个抓手都不成立时，转看<strong>干支上神之间暗拱的那个字</strong>——这正是他在例42 吃了亏之后总结出来的路子。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">细详干支上神，<strong>拱地盘子地，为山东</strong>，<strong>卯为草，必有草头处也</strong>。</q>⇒ 山东 ＋ 地名带草头。查当时的空缺：<strong>莘县、蓬莱</strong>二缺 ⇒ 再取<q class=\"yw\"><strong>子又水乡</strong></q>⇒ 断<strong>蓬莱</strong>（临海）。后果：至十月乙亥日，<strong>果签选蓬莱</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　另一条路（程树勋按）：以支为任所</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：同一课，别家有别的取法，一并记住，实盘时哪条算得通用哪条。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">愚尝<strong>以支为任所</strong>，支上<strong>寅为山</strong>，<strong>玄武为草头</strong>，又为近水之处，<strong>寅加长生为道士</strong>，彼道家有<strong>蓬莱山在海中</strong>之说，似与县名符合，况木加长生则发生，<strong>蓬莱之莱字亦有木字形</strong>也。</q>&lt;br&gt;⭐ 叶注另附古法：<strong>取本命禄神下辰为分野</strong>；又取垣中禽星之生本命者为禄方。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">据此课，天上行年临酉，岂赵人选赵地乎？官星为用，临丑，北人难得吴越，驿马不在传，又临燕，亦本地也。<strong>细详干支上神，拱地盘子地，为山东，卯为草，必有草头处也</strong>。查现缺有莘县、蓬莱二缺，<strong>必为蓬莱</strong>，以子又水乡也，至十月乙亥日，果签选蓬莱。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：行年临酉为赵（赵人不选赵地）＋官星临丑为吴越（北人难得）＋驿马临寅为燕（本地）→常法候选全排除＋干支上神暗拱子（山东）·卯为草头·子为水乡（蓬莱）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：不会派回本地，也不是吴越；应在山东、地名带草头又临水——蓬莱（后果如断）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 分野：寅燕·酉赵·丑吴越·子山东　② ⭐ 常法候选要先过事理这一关　③ 干支上神暗拱之字可用　④ 从字取地名（草头·水乡）　⑤ 另有以支为任所、本命禄神下辰为分野两条路</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例六十四（郭御青占刘梦言任所）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p161｜PDF p893〕</span></p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote class=\"star\"><p>⭐ <strong>以下出自《大六壬通解》下册<q class=\"yw\">历代六壬课例</q></strong>——出处可按页码逐句回查，盘为复算并与原书三传交叉验证过。</p></blockquote>", "q46": "<h3 id=\"例46-辛巳日-省试能中-殿试却不第-两场要分开看-天将-年命-课体-旬空\">【例46】⭐ 辛巳日 · 省试能中，殿试却不第——两场要分开看 <code>天将</code> <code>年命</code> <code>课体</code> <code>旬空</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：重审课 · 辛巳日亥将申时 · 三传申亥寅皆临长生，发用乘朱雀传入青龙太常，太岁不入传、青龙临空</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：元丰八年二月<strong>辛巳日</strong>申时，太学的李明（癸未生，四十三岁）占<strong>科举</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 省试与殿试看的字不同 / 朱雀＋青龙＋太常＋功曹＝文场得意 / 太岁与青龙才管殿试 / 白虎入墓＋刑＝不承恩命</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">兄弟　朱雀　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　子孙　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　太常</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>申 → 亥 → 寅</strong>，<strong>三传皆临长生</strong>；发用乘<strong>朱雀</strong>、传入<strong>青龙、太常</strong>；所乘<strong>功曹（寅）</strong>本是青龙、春占为旺气；但<strong>太岁不入传</strong>、<strong>青龙正临空亡</strong>；日上<strong>丑土乘白虎作墓神</strong>，且<strong>丑戌相刑</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 先分清：省试一套字，殿试另一套字</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：科举不是一场。<strong>省试（会试）</strong>看<strong>朱雀、青龙、太常、功曹</strong>这类文书文场之神；<strong>殿试</strong>则专看<q class=\"yw\"><strong>太岁、青龙</strong></q>——<q class=\"yw\">法以<strong>太岁、青龙为殿试</strong></q>。&lt;br&gt;两套字各自成立与否，结果可以完全相反。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本课两套字一好一坏，所以断语才会是<q class=\"yw\"><strong>必主高中，只是不承恩命</strong></q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　省试为什么高中</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：把文场那几个字逐个查：发用乘什么、传入什么、旺不旺、与月建有没有关系。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>发用朱雀，传入龙常，三传皆临长生</strong>，行年又得<strong>青龙</strong>，传入<strong>太常，正属省府</strong>，所乘<strong>功曹</strong>本是青龙，<strong>春占为旺气</strong>，与<strong>月建上神三合</strong>，贵人顺治发用在前</q>⇒ 断<strong>省试高选、榜首</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　殿试为什么不成</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：殿试的两个字：<strong>太岁</strong>要入传、<strong>青龙</strong>要不空。少一样就悬。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">今<strong>太岁不入</strong>，<strong>青龙正临空亡</strong>，<strong>魁罡加太岁本命</strong>，又日上<strong>丑土乘白虎作墓神</strong>，辛刑此，<strong>丑戌相刑，白虎入墓</strong></q>⇒ 断<strong>不承恩命</strong>。&lt;br&gt;后果：省榜果然第一，殿试却<strong>因犯御讳</strong>而不及第——<q class=\"yw\">不承恩命</q>四字落到实处。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　这一例真正的用处</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：遇到一件分几段的事（考试、诉讼、审批、多轮面试），<strong>先把每一段各自对应的字定下来，再分段断</strong>，不要用一个笼统的吉凶盖过去。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：⭐ 本课就是范例：同一张盘，<strong>前一段大吉、后一段落空</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">若占<strong>省试必主高中，只是不承恩命</strong>，省榜子当为首，当殿试为犯御讳，遂不及第。</q>&lt;br&gt;议曰：<q class=\"yw\">发用朱雀，传入龙常，三传皆临长生……所乘功曹，本是青龙，春占为旺气，与月建上神三合……故主省试高选。<strong>法以太岁、青龙为殿试</strong>，今<strong>太岁不入，青龙正临空亡</strong>……<strong>白虎入墓，故主不承恩命也</strong>。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：发用朱雀传入龙常·三传皆临长生·功曹春旺与月建三合（省试高选）＋太岁不入传·青龙临空亡·日上丑乘白虎作墓又丑戌相刑（殿试不承恩命）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：省试必中且是榜首；殿试不成（后果因犯御讳而不第）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① ⭐ 一件事分几段，就分几套字来看　② 省试：朱雀·青龙·太常·功曹＋旺气＋与月建三合　③ 殿试：太岁入传、青龙不空　④ 白虎入墓＋刑＝恩命不承</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例一（僧仲褒占李明省试，《一针见血》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p97｜PDF p829〕</span></p>\n<hr>"});